Dialogue: 99,0:00:02.13,0:00:07.00,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,On that day during summer vacation,\N you knew that the school would go adrift.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:08.09,0:00:10.00,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,So why did you still go?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:10.42,0:00:13.00,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,That's right, I knew everything.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:13.48,0:00:17.29,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,And that's why I did—\NI couldn't just leave everyone to it.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:17.29,0:00:19.09,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,But what was the point?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:20.28,0:00:21.39,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:21.84,0:00:25.01,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Did they ask for your salvation?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:26.12,0:00:27.64,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Is this world a movie theater?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.20,0:00:30.88,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,No, this is no ordinary movie theater.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:32.39,0:00:33.52,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:34.87,0:00:36.56,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It's your point of view.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:44.64,0:00:48.65,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Skimming through this, it looks like\N the whole film was shot from your perspective.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:48.65,0:00:51.79,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I... d-don't have a hidden camera or anything!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:53.67,0:00:55.33,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:56.37,0:00:58.29,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Then who on earth did this?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:58.29,0:01:02.13,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I can't say I know for sure yet,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:02.13,0:01:06.41,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,but this might be the first world that shows us other worlds.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.41,0:01:09.43,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,This may be some sort of special place.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:10.09,0:01:11.94,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Have you not found Nagara yet?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:12.48,0:01:16.36,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,It's been two months!\N What the hell have you been doing?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:16.36,0:01:18.11,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Sir, yes, sir!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:18.11,0:01:20.62,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,He appears to be constantly moving from world to world,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:20.62,0:01:23.82,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,and we can't seem to locate him using the power relics, sir!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:23.82,0:01:27.40,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,He's not capable of coming up with\N anything that intelligent on his own.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:27.40,0:01:29.91,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,He must have collaborators working with him!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:29.91,0:01:32.96,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,They are just as guilty!\N Find them, no matter the cost!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:33.25,0:01:34.96,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Sir, yes, sir!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:46.16,0:01:48.72,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Mizuho sure is taking her time. I'm starving.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.12,0:01:52.17,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,She should be here any moment now.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:52.80,0:01:54.64,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I have some chocolate if you want some.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:54.64,0:01:55.60,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:00.02,0:02:01.65,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,A-A stray dog?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:02.60,0:02:08.38,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,Mmm, you smell good.\N The sweet smell of chocolate.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:08.78,0:02:10.11,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I-It talked!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.11,0:02:11.60,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,The dog talked!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:13.48,0:02:14.12,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Shake!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:15.12,0:02:16.13,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Sit!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:16.13,0:02:16.95,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Sit up!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:17.70,0:02:20.63,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce you. This is Yamabiko.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:22.78,0:02:26.89,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,It sounds like he drifted into this world, just like us.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:29.95,0:02:34.77,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,He said he used to be human,\N but suddenly transformed at some point.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:35.33,0:02:36.77,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,There, there, there...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:40.45,0:02:41.78,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,Pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:42.82,0:02:45.82,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,A veteran castaway... dog?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:47.34,0:02:48.66,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Ugh, that stinks.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:49.48,0:02:54.63,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,If you're a castaway like us,\N does that mean you're also in stasis?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:54.63,0:02:55.29,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:55.71,0:02:59.83,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Then why are you a dog? Is it some sort of power?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:01.03,0:03:04.00,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,Dog or not, I'm still myself.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:04.01,0:03:05.92,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,You see? I haven't—
Dialogue: 99,0:03:07.84,0:03:10.76,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,So where have you been all this time?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:10.76,0:03:14.96,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,I was living in the forest, but the storm\N that came through drove me out of there.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:14.96,0:03:16.37,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Does he mean Asakaze?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:16.37,0:03:18.58,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Most likely.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:19.36,0:03:20.31,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Do you know...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:21.48,0:03:22.82,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,what's causing this drifting?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:24.35,0:03:25.82,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,{\i1}That{\i0} I don't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:27.68,0:03:29.79,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Are we ever going to get home?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:30.53,0:03:34.75,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,Many who came before me attempted to get back to their own world,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.75,0:03:36.83,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,but none have been successful.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:37.95,0:03:40.38,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,Though that doesn't mean there's no hope.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:40.38,0:03:42.37,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Huh? So we {\i1}can{\i0} go home?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:42.37,0:03:43.43,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:44.79,0:03:46.09,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,There's still time.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.57,0:03:51.82,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,It hasn't been a year since you got here, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:53.53,0:03:56.63,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Whew, we're so close to being finished.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:56.63,0:03:57.81,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:57.81,0:04:00.35,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,We just have to collect the material for its core.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:01.85,0:04:04.82,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Do we really not have to go looking for it?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:05.36,0:04:08.33,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Apparently it's going to come to us.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:10.56,0:04:11.24,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:11.76,0:04:13.24,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,How's things?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:13.91,0:04:17.49,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,It sure has been a while, hasn't it?\N What have you been up to all this time?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:17.49,0:04:20.62,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,We've been hopping between different worlds with Nagara,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:20.62,0:04:23.77,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,looking for the piece we need to get us back home.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:23.77,0:04:25.75,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't we all go home together?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:26.94,0:04:30.02,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,I think we've already given you our answer to that.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:31.23,0:04:33.51,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,The outcome is already decided.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:33.93,0:04:35.51,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,We can't go home.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:35.79,0:04:38.01,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Our only choice is to live here.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:38.98,0:04:43.46,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Don't give me that nonsense about the outcome already being decided.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:43.46,0:04:47.11,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Isn't it up to youngsters like us to keep trying anyway?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:47.92,0:04:52.86,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,We're inside the light right now. Just one step away.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:53.96,0:04:57.17,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I never imagined there was someone adrift longer than us.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.17,0:05:01.40,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,He said there was still time.\N That we're still connected.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:01.40,0:05:02.91,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Yeah, he did.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:02.91,0:05:05.73,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Could he mean that whatever is holding that connection in place
Dialogue: 99,0:05:05.73,0:05:08.44,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,might be somewhere in this world?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:09.18,0:05:10.84,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Yeah, could be.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:11.49,0:05:14.46,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Provided that your power is what created these worlds,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:14.46,0:05:17.60,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,and that you held this power even in {\i1}our{\i0} world,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:18.05,0:05:22.98,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,the school might have been\N something akin to another world.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:23.53,0:05:28.85,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,And if that's true, then maybe there's a film of our world in here, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:28.86,0:05:33.58,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,The fact that we weren't the first ones to go adrift,\N and that it happened to others from our school,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:33.58,0:05:35.87,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,might support that theory.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.61,0:05:39.49,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,You guys seem to have gotten the wrong impression.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:40.44,0:05:44.21,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,Hourglass,I was also a 3rd-year student at Shiraito Middle School No. 2,{(QC) perhaps join this, but tell me which you chose either way, since the end of this line probs needs some retiming}
Dialogue: 99,0:05:44.21,0:05:46.00,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,the same as all of you.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:46.00,0:05:48.85,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Huh? From the same school?\N Then we're classmates?!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:48.85,0:05:50.39,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Who are you? What's your name?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:50.39,0:05:51.90,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Yamada Kunihiko.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:53.00,0:05:54.95,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Was there anyone there with that name?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:54.95,0:05:57.35,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,It's no surprise that you wouldn't know me.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:57.35,0:06:00.87,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,See, I enrolled the year that you graduated.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:01.46,0:06:02.94,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Wait, then that means...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:02.94,0:06:04.14,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Isn't that strange?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:04.59,0:06:07.65,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,That would mean that you're here from the future.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:07.65,0:06:09.27,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,Space-time is flexible.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.59,0:06:13.40,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,How long have you been here, then?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:13.81,0:06:15.66,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,5,000 years.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.67,0:06:22.58,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,But when he says 5,000 years,\N it just doesn't seem real, does it?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:22.58,0:06:24.33,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Plus, he turned into a dog.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:25.33,0:06:27.54,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Whoa! What just happened?!{Wow, PTSD from when I had glasses. My vision was roughly this bad. - Lann}
Dialogue: 99,0:06:27.54,0:06:28.49,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:29.54,0:06:30.97,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,S-Sorry!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:31.87,0:06:32.60,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:34.13,0:06:35.80,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,What did you just do?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:36.96,0:06:41.93,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,This is footage of us since we moved to the island.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.44,0:06:43.32,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Fetch.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:44.53,0:06:45.68,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:46.35,0:06:47.91,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Let's try a little experiment.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:47.91,0:06:48.81,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:50.36,0:06:53.57,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,This is an app I made for video editing.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:00.44,0:07:01.33,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Does that mean...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:01.33,0:07:03.17,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It sure does.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:03.17,0:07:07.10,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Any changes to the film also have an effect on the real world.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:08.05,0:07:09.76,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Let's experiment a little more.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:10.59,0:07:13.59,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,These are the images from that film.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:14.02,0:07:18.09,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Now we add something else—\Nlike the great Monkey Mountain.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:25.22,0:07:28.80,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Fascinating, isn't it? By editing two worlds together,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:28.80,0:07:30.36,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,we can create a composite.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:30.90,0:07:33.09,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Amazing. You could do anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.53,0:07:37.81,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Actually, I already tried this once...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:37.81,0:07:41.37,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,Hourglass,But nothing happened.{QC}{(Timing) I split different, but dunno what to do with this.}{(QC) Let's get Hourglass into the thread for this too, maybe joining the lines is preferable, maybe adding a fade is preferable, idk}
Dialogue: 99,0:07:41.78,0:07:45.81,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,The only difference now is that you're here taking part in the preview.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:46.62,0:07:50.67,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Which means that simply editing the film doesn't alter the world.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:50.67,0:07:54.13,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,The crucial element is whether or not you're here watching it.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:56.44,0:08:00.14,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Okay, then what would happen if we played it backwards?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:03.02,0:08:04.89,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,There's trouble on the horizon.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:05.64,0:08:07.91,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Are you sure we should be leaving this up to them?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:07.91,0:08:10.56,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,You mean those delicate little mice?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:10.56,0:08:14.90,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,They're as pure as can be,\N and haven't gotten any preferential treatment.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:14.90,0:08:17.39,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,They need me to watch over them.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:18.47,0:08:20.16,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,We just need to keep an eye on those brats
Dialogue: 99,0:08:20.16,0:08:25.00,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,who are overconfident in the powers\N they've been given and dare to defy God.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:25.00,0:08:29.09,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Their plot would bring about the end of the world.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:29.09,0:08:31.52,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,The end of the world?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:31.52,0:08:35.63,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Yeah. We have to prevent that, whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:36.28,0:08:39.13,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,You're the only one who can protect everyone.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:39.51,0:08:41.49,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,You understand that, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:41.49,0:08:43.87,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,There's nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:43.87,0:08:48.70,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Your power and my sense of relativity were made for each other.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:51.28,0:08:55.90,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Hey, are you ever coming back?\N I'd love to get the gang together again.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:56.72,0:08:57.86,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,You've got Nagara, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:58.40,0:09:01.23,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Yeah, Nagara's giving it his all.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:01.23,0:09:04.31,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,He's trying to prove to himself that he can stand up to the world.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:04.31,0:09:06.37,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Our very own Nagara!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:11.19,0:09:16.07,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Looks like playing it backwards goes against the rules of this world.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:16.07,0:09:19.28,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I was thinking we could go back to before we went adrift,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:19.28,0:09:20.97,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,but I guess it's not that easy.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:23.01,0:09:24.97,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,We can see the past, but we can't change it.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:25.47,0:09:28.74,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Which means that effects can't happen without their causes.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:30.28,0:09:31.73,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:31.73,0:09:33.73,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Oh, that one's no good.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:33.73,0:09:36.23,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It's been eaten by mold, and it's the wrong size.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:41.33,0:09:41.99,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:46.89,0:09:49.87,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,You really are special.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:51.85,0:09:55.00,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,We might be able to go home now.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:55.83,0:09:58.00,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,So you have a new project, then?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:58.36,0:10:01.59,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I do. I call it the "Director's Cut" project.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:02.02,0:10:03.22,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:03.22,0:10:08.07,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,A director's cut is when a movie that has already been in theaters
Dialogue: 99,0:10:08.07,0:10:11.05,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,gets re-edited, and becomes a remade production.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:11.05,0:10:14.89,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,In the same way, I'm thinking of having us do a director's cut.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:14.89,0:10:15.60,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Of what?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:16.23,0:10:18.98,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Of ourselves and this world.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:22.31,0:10:26.44,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,We are castaways who ended up in this world by mistake.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:26.44,0:10:30.87,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,And over here, we have another reel of film that Nagara found.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:32.56,0:10:36.90,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,This film shows our own world,\N where we're supposed to be.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:37.97,0:10:39.64,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Wow, that takes me back!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.64,0:10:41.01,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,But you were a transfer student.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:41.01,0:10:42.13,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:42.13,0:10:45.44,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,We're going to paste ourselves in here where we're missing,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:45.44,0:10:47.14,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,and re-edit our own world.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:48.28,0:10:50.89,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,We're going to remake our own world ourselves.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:50.89,0:10:54.02,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Who's gonna pull off something as ambitious as that?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:54.02,0:10:55.24,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Nagara, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:56.39,0:10:57.27,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:57.87,0:11:02.15,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Even if it's a hurdle we can't get over, Nagara is able to.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:03.90,0:11:05.65,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,We can't change the past.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:06.11,0:11:09.46,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,But we can change the future as much as we like.{Natsume really going full "DO YOU GET IT YET" on this one lmfao}
Dialogue: 99,0:11:13.08,0:11:15.41,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,What if the future is already decided?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:16.29,0:11:18.81,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,We already know how it turns out.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:20.37,0:11:22.92,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Is knowing really all that great?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:24.55,0:11:27.05,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Yeah. I {\i1}am{\i0} that great.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:27.41,0:11:31.20,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,No matter how impressive you are,\N you can't change the future.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:31.20,0:11:35.57,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,You should use your power in a way that's more helpful to all of us.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:35.57,0:11:38.89,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,This shelter, you see, is actually an ark.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:38.89,0:11:43.50,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,With it, I will save us all from the coming disaster.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:44.86,0:11:46.80,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,It's not like we asked for this.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:47.70,0:11:48.82,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:49.41,0:11:51.16,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Even if the outcome is set in stone,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:52.08,0:11:53.08,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I'm not running from it.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:54.74,0:11:55.58,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:55.96,0:11:58.46,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Nagara's right. Hoshi, we ought to—
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.46,0:12:03.16,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Cap, have I ever been wrong about anything?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:03.16,0:12:04.09,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:04.80,0:12:06.85,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,But even so...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:08.26,0:12:11.04,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,I don't believe in keeping to the beaten path,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:11.04,0:12:14.35,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,then breathing a sigh of relief when you arrive safely.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:15.16,0:12:17.85,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,That's not how you should live your life.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:22.52,0:12:23.74,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Oh dear.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:23.74,0:12:27.36,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Nagara, I think it's about time to relocate to another world.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:34.20,0:12:36.13,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Let's quit this, already.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:36.13,0:12:40.52,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,No matter how many power relics we collect,\N we'll never be able to beat Asakaze and the others.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:40.52,0:12:43.88,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,I'm starting to wonder if we were wrong after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:53.16,0:12:56.13,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Is it true that you were able to change the world?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:56.13,0:12:59.39,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Yeah. It worked perfectly in our experiments,\N for the most part.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:59.79,0:13:01.02,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,For the most part?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:01.02,0:13:05.47,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Yeah... There are times when the editing works,\N and times when it doesn't.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:05.47,0:13:08.53,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It seems like there's some kind of random chance at play.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:08.53,0:13:12.74,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Are you sure we'll be all right?\N Nothing strange is going to happen?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:12.74,0:13:14.15,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,No, nothing like that.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:14.15,0:13:18.05,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,This is based on the fact that only things that {\i1}can{\i0} happen {\i1}will{\i0} happen.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:18.05,0:13:20.16,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,You being who you are isn't going to change.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:20.85,0:13:21.79,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:22.98,0:13:26.72,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,You'll be fine! You're not going to suddenly turn into a dog or anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:26.72,0:13:31.80,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,For one thing, this world is set up so that things work in the students' favor.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:32.26,0:13:37.11,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Why are only students who went to {\i1}our{\i0} school going adrift?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:37.59,0:13:41.31,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,That's because the principal is God.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:41.31,0:13:42.81,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:43.19,0:13:45.81,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,The principal? You mean {\i1}our{\i0} principal?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:46.38,0:13:50.07,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,This drifting was brought about according to His will.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:50.07,0:13:53.60,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Huh? But why would God be our principal?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:53.60,0:13:56.55,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,It's nothing more than simple coincidence.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:56.55,0:13:59.08,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,He just happened to be the principal.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:59.08,0:14:02.45,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,He just happened to be? But even if that's so,
Dialogue: 99,0:14:02.45,0:14:05.33,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,what is the point of us going adrift?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:05.33,0:14:06.83,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,There is no point.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:07.20,0:14:08.59,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,Nil.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:12.00,0:14:16.22,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,It's from Ace. He says they want to meet up.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:16.22,0:14:20.00,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Huh?! Why now, after everything they put Nagara through?!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:20.00,0:14:20.86,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Let them come.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:20.86,0:14:22.77,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Huh? Seriously?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:22.77,0:14:27.25,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,If they've taken the steps to contacting us,\N they must have seen the error of their ways.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:27.25,0:14:30.00,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Besides, if they're in trouble,\N we should extend a helping hand.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.00,0:14:31.58,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Make them beg! Make them beg!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:31.58,0:14:34.24,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,This is what the ark is for.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:37.70,0:14:41.87,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Okay, this is where we'll do it.\N This is where we'll build our ark.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:41.87,0:14:43.00,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Ark?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:43.00,0:14:47.25,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Yeah. I have to save everyone. You understand, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:47.66,0:14:51.25,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,You see, I want to save all of you.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:51.83,0:14:55.01,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Hey, are you sure we shouldn't be helping Rajdhani and the others?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:55.01,0:14:55.78,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:55.78,0:14:56.51,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:56.94,0:15:00.38,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Because the way things are going,\N it seems like we're never going home.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:00.38,0:15:02.39,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,And what if we don't?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:02.95,0:15:07.15,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Even if we never go home,\N it has no bearing on our previous world.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:07.62,0:15:09.90,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,You're going to save everyone.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:10.34,0:15:13.65,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,I just want to save everyone.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:14.29,0:15:17.41,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did they ask for your salvation?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:18.75,0:15:20.58,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Are you sure this is the way to go?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:21.72,0:15:24.33,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Just doing exactly as you're told...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:24.33,0:15:27.33,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,It isn't like you.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:30.62,0:15:31.84,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,If we get home tomorrow,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:31.84,0:15:34.28,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,we'll be just in time for our graduation.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:34.28,0:15:37.84,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Do you think we could still graduate after missing this much school?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:39.41,0:15:40.60,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:52.06,0:15:53.96,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,You can't fly anymore.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:56.04,0:15:57.61,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Today's our graduation ceremony.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:02.77,0:16:04.37,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:08.53,0:16:11.41,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Our shelter has now become an ark.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:16.24,0:16:19.38,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,When will you finally understand?!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:19.89,0:16:22.39,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Give it up, already!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:33.83,0:16:35.90,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Ms. Aki! Listen to me, please!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:35.90,0:16:39.86,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It's not possible for this project to cause the end of the world!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:39.86,0:16:42.03,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,No, it is ending!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:42.03,0:16:43.58,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,A teacher?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.58,0:16:45.12,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,No, that can't be.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:45.12,0:16:46.08,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:46.08,0:16:49.20,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,All that ever goes adrift are the school and its students.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:49.20,0:16:50.66,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Huh? But...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:53.35,0:16:56.18,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,There's no choice but for you to stay!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:57.23,0:16:59.30,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Stop them.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:29.81,0:17:31.79,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Is Nagara doing this?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:32.86,0:17:35.19,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,The world really has changed.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:35.19,0:17:37.17,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Great, looks like it worked.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.97,0:17:40.30,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Let's move on to the project. Agreed?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:41.57,0:17:45.05,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay. Let's give it a try.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:46.24,0:17:47.89,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,They said they're ready whenever.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:48.78,0:17:50.39,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,We're ready here, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:50.39,0:17:53.10,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Okay, let's all go home together!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:54.09,0:17:54.94,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.48,0:18:10.67,Default,Teachers,0,0,0,,Honestly, what are we going to do about your mother?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:12.32,0:18:14.75,Default,Teachers,0,0,0,,Can't you just make a decision on your own already?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:14.75,0:18:17.68,Default,Teachers,0,0,0,,We need to do more than just discuss this over and over.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:17.68,0:18:19.25,Default,Teachers,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:22.05,0:18:23.26,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,{\i1}When did that get there?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:18:22.46,0:18:23.26,Alt Styling,Classmates,0,0,0,,Miss!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:23.70,0:18:25.84,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,There's a dead bird at the front gate.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:25.84,0:18:27.85,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,It's gross. Please do something about it.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:27.85,0:18:29.29,Default,Teachers,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:31.26,0:18:34.77,Default,Teachers,0,0,0,,It's not right to take things out on those weaker than you.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:35.37,0:18:37.42,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,No, that isn't what I...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:46.95,0:18:48.20,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:48.20,0:18:48.91,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,The light...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:50.06,0:18:51.75,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,The light is here.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:51.75,0:18:54.16,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,The light? The one you've been talking about?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:54.58,0:18:58.17,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Yeah. We were right after all!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:09.79,0:19:13.72,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,You are all no longer needed.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:24.74,0:19:26.31,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Asakaze!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:38.76,0:19:39.91,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:52.20,0:19:54.77,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I'm... here.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:34.75,0:20:36.43,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,What a pity.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:37.97,0:20:42.61,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,You always have to screen the future to see what will happen.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.61,0:20:43.94,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:44.35,0:20:47.69,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,You were not creating worlds.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:47.97,0:20:52.45,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,You were just an observer,\N opening boxes of possibilities.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:54.61,0:20:58.08,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,This world exists because you are here.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:59.25,0:21:03.33,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,You are simply copies.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:03.33,0:21:07.26,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Huh? What's going on? There's another me here.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:08.08,0:21:10.09,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,We were not chosen.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:11.00,0:21:13.59,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,We no longer have a place to go home to.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:14.52,0:21:17.71,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I get it. This wasn't us going adrift—
Dialogue: 99,0:21:18.46,0:21:20.62,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,it was God rolling the dice.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.39,0:21:36.59,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Did you really think that you were the only special ones?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:37.37,0:21:39.62,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,They ended up failing, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:40.00,0:21:42.12,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,They were so close, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:43.77,0:21:46.13,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your graduation!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:58.37,0:22:01.19,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Are you sure that this was for the best?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:01.19,0:22:04.44,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Yeah. The world has been preserved.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:06.43,0:22:09.02,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Sorry. It didn't work.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:09.02,0:22:10.82,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It's not your fault, Nagara.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:10.82,0:22:13.28,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,In the end, it was a matter of probability.{(QC) remove comma}
Dialogue: 99,0:22:13.28,0:22:14.07,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:14.40,0:22:17.07,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,There was a chance that we would become the originals.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:17.89,0:22:19.43,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,I've underestimated you, Nagara.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:21.37,0:22:24.39,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey, I thought you said there was still time.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:24.39,0:22:28.33,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,Eight months fits within the margin of error of life.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:29.68,0:22:32.21,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,There's no chance left for me, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:39.21,0:22:40.72,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,We have to get going.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:44.23,0:22:46.45,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,I was dead.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:46.45,0:22:46.98,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:49.83,0:22:52.48,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,So what could the light have been, then?
